docker ps

Kafka UI: http://localhost:8081


Topic: orders

Group 1: order-processing-group
Group 2: analytics-group
Group 3: high-value-orders-group
Different groups = each group gets its own copy of the data


docker exec -it kafka bash

Create Kafka Topic

kafka-topics \
  --create \
  --topic orders \
  --bootstrap-server kafka:9092 \
  --partitions 3 \
  --replication-factor 1


Check topic:

kafka-topics \
  --list \
  --bootstrap-server kafka:9092

Describe topic:

kafka-topics \
  --describe \
  --topic orders \
  --bootstrap-server kafka:9092

Delete Topic

kafka-topics \
  --delete \
  --topic orders \
  --bootstrap-server kafka:9092

